<config xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="urn:magento:module:Magento_Config:etc/system_file.xsd">
    <system>
        <section id="mppricebargain" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="300" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
            <label>Name Your Price</label>
            <tab>mageplaza</tab>
            <resource>Mageplaza_NameYourPrice::configuration</resource>
            <group id="general" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="10" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                <label>General</label>
                <field id="enabled" translate="label comment" type="select" sortOrder="10" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Enable</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                    <comment>Select Yes to enable this module</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="customer_groups" translate="label comment" type="multiselect" sortOrder="20" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Customer Group(s)</label>
                    <source_model>Mageplaza\NameYourPrice\Model\Config\Source\CustomerGroups</source_model>
                </field>
                <field id="condition" translate="label comment" sortOrder="30" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Apply For</label>
                    <frontend_model>Mageplaza\NameYourPrice\Block\Adminhtml\System\Config\Condition</frontend_model>
                    <backend_model>Mageplaza\NameYourPrice\Model\Config\Backend\Condition</backend_model>
                    <comment>If no condition, bargain function will be applied to all products.</comment>
                    <depends>
                        <field id="enabled_condition">1</field>
                    </depends>
                </field>
                <field id="price_type" translate="label comment" type="select" sortOrder="40" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Bargain Price Type</label>
                    <source_model>Mageplaza\NameYourPrice\Model\Config\Source\PriceType</source_model>
                </field>
                <field id="price_value" translate="label comment" sortOrder="50" type="text" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Min Bargain Value</label>
                    <validate>validate-digits validate-greater-than-zero</validate>
                </field>
                <field id="is_tax" translate="label comment" type="select" sortOrder="55" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Apply For Tax</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                    <comment>If Yes, tax will be included in the bargain price of customers. Default is No.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="allow_discount" translate="label comment" type="select" sortOrder="57" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Allow Using Discounts</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                    <comment>If Yes, the approved bargain products can be applied with current discounts (from cart price rules, coupon codes, affiliate policies)</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="limit_time" translate="label comment" sortOrder="60" type="text" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Bargain Usage Time</label>
                    <validate>validate-not-negative-number</validate>
                    <comment>Day(s). Number of days that customers can use their bargain price after being approved by the admin. If empty or 0, there is no time limitation.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="bargain_qty" translate="label comment" type="select" sortOrder="70" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Commit Minimum Quantity</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                    <comment>If Yes, the customer will have to fill in a quantity to get bargain authorization. If admins approve the bargain, the customer will have to buy with the minimum of this quantity.</comment>
                </field>
            </group>
            <group id="display" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="20" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                <label>Bargain Form</label>
                <field id="is_popup" translate="label comment" type="select" sortOrder="10" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Use Popup</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                    <comment>If Yes, the form will display via popup. If No, the form will appear right below the Price Bargain button</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="fields" translate="label comment" type="multiselect" sortOrder="20" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Additional Fields</label>
                    <source_model>Mageplaza\NameYourPrice\Model\Config\Source\Fields</source_model>
                    <comment>The default form includes the fields: bargain price and customer's email.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="button_label" translate="label comment" sortOrder="30" type="text" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Button Label</label>
                    <comment>Default: Price Bargain</comment>
                </field>
            </group>
            <group id="email" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="30" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                <label>Notification Email</label>
                <field id="enabled" translate="label comment" type="select" sortOrder="10" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Enable</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                    <comment><![CDATA[Install <a href="https://www.mageplaza.com/magento-2-smtp/?utm_source=mageplaza&utm_medium=mageplaza&utm_campaign=mageplaza-review&utm_content=SMTP" target="_blank">Mageplaza_SMTP</a> to avoid sending emails to spam box.]]></comment>
                </field>
                <field id="sender" translate="label comment" type="select" sortOrder="20" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Sender</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Email\Identity</source_model>
                </field>
                <field id="admin_email" translate="label comment" type="textarea" sortOrder="25" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Admin Email</label>
                    <comment><![CDATA[Separated by comma(,). When the customer submits a bargain request, a notification email will be sent to the admin via this address.]]></comment>
                </field>
                <field id="template_confirm" translate="label comment" type="select" sortOrder="30" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Confirmation Email</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Email\Template</source_model>
                </field>
                <field id="template_approve" translate="label comment" type="select" sortOrder="40" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Approval Email</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Email\Template</source_model>
                </field>
                <field id="template_reject" translate="label comment" type="select" sortOrder="50" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Rejection Email</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Email\Template</source_model>
                </field>
            </group>
        </section>
    </system>
</config>
